# Environment Variables

Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in your API keys.

```bash
cp .env.example .env.local
```

---

## 🌐 Site Configuration

```env
# Production: https://iqsnapshot.vercel.app
# Development: http://localhost:3000
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000
```

---

## 💳 Stripe Configuration

Get your keys from: https://dashboard.stripe.com/apikeys

### Development (Test Mode)
```env
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_YOUR_TEST_KEY_HERE
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_YOUR_TEST_WEBHOOK_SECRET
```

### Production (Live Mode)
```env
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_live_YOUR_LIVE_KEY_HERE
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_YOUR_LIVE_WEBHOOK_SECRET
```

### Optional: Pre-created Price IDs
Leave blank to use dynamic pricing (recommended):
```env
STRIPE_PRICE_ID=
STRIPE_BUMP_PRICE_ID=
```

Or create fixed prices in Stripe dashboard and use their IDs:
```env
STRIPE_PRICE_ID=price_xxxxx  # $1 base price
STRIPE_BUMP_PRICE_ID=price_xxxxx  # $7 PDF upgrade
```

---

## 📧 Resend Email Configuration

Get your API key from: https://resend.com/api-keys

```env
RESEND_API_KEY=re_YOUR_API_KEY_HERE
FROM_EMAIL=noreply@yourdomain.com
```

**Important:** The `FROM_EMAIL` domain must be verified in Resend.  
See: https://resend.com/domains

---

## 🔗 Affiliate Configuration

```env
# Optional: VSL redirect URL after results
NEXT_PUBLIC_AFFILIATE_VSL_URL=https://your-vsl-url.com/course?aff=123
```

---

## 🔐 Security

```env
# JWT secret for result tokens (optional)
# Generate with: openssl rand -base64 32
RESULT_JWT_SECRET=your-secret-key-min-32-chars
```

---

## 🧪 A/B Testing Flags

### Price Disclosure Mode
```env
# upfront: Show $1 price on landing page
# soft: Show price only when quiz starts
NEXT_PUBLIC_PRICE_DISCLOSURE_MODE=upfront
```

### Headline Variants
```env
# A: "How Smart Are You Compared to Other Americans?"
# B: "7‑Minute IQ Snapshot: Discover Your Score..."
NEXT_PUBLIC_HEADLINE_VARIANT=A
```

### VSL Headline Variants
```env
# A: "Boost Your Cognitive Edge in 30 Days"
# B: "Turn Your IQ Insights into Daily Performance Gains"
NEXT_PUBLIC_VSL_HEADLINE_VARIANT=A
```

---

## 🚀 Quick Setup Example

```env
# Site
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Stripe (Test Mode)
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_51xxxxx
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_xxxxx
STRIPE_PRICE_ID=
STRIPE_BUMP_PRICE_ID=

# Resend
RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxx
FROM_EMAIL=noreply@yourdomain.com

# Affiliate (optional)
NEXT_PUBLIC_AFFILIATE_VSL_URL=https://example.com/vsl

# Security
RESULT_JWT_SECRET=generate-a-random-32-char-string-here

# A/B Testing
NEXT_PUBLIC_PRICE_DISCLOSURE_MODE=upfront
NEXT_PUBLIC_HEADLINE_VARIANT=A
NEXT_PUBLIC_VSL_HEADLINE_VARIANT=A
```

---

## 📝 Notes

- Never commit `.env.local` to git (it's in `.gitignore`)
- Use test keys for local development
- Use live keys only in production (Vercel)
- Verify email domain in Resend before production
- Create webhook in Stripe for your production URL
